WCN36xx hardware wire definitions, Linux v6.12, ISC licensed (not Linux ABI).
Source: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/tree/v6.12/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx
hal.h unchanged. dxe.h and txrx.h (bd.h here) retain only wire definitions;
Linux includes and driver bookkeeping/prototypes removed. config.h extracts
the WCN36xx production startup defaults from smd.c. Each file retains license.
SOS2 implements its own scheduler, transport, DMA and station state machines.
